---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import RandomWalk from '../components/RandomWalk';
const startId = Astro.url.searchParams.get('from') ?? undefined;
---
<Base title="随机漫步 | 18mu-blog" description="沿博客知识库的语义关联重新遇见旧内容" section="blog"><section class="page-intro"><div class="eyebrow">Knowledge feature / 02</div><h1>随机漫步</h1><p>没有目的地地重访内容。你可以从一篇刚读完的文章开始，也可以把起点交给系统，沿着语义关联走向下一篇。</p></section><RandomWalk client:load startId={startId} /></Base>
